				1861,
				1
			],
			"Message": "style(Mountain): Replace em dashes with hyphens in README.md\n\nConsistently replace all em dash characters (`—`) with standard hyphens (`-`) throughout the README.md, affecting the Feature list, Architecture table, Dependencies table, Security table, and Related Documentation links. The change moves from typographic punctuation to plain ASCII for consistency with the surrounding codebase documentation conventions.\n\nNo behavioral or semantic changes — prose style alignment only.",
			"SHA": "c8f239f13c0c09ef81f4d73cf9180e840f67beed"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-12T20:04:43Z",
			"File": [
				"⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1861,
				90
			],
			"Message": "docs(Mountain): Add doc comments across RPC, Environment, and Vine modules\n\nAdd module-level `///` doc comments to every `pub mod` declaration in the\nCocoonService handler suite (Auth, Command, Debug, Extension, FileSystem,\nInitialization, Output, Provider, SCM, Secret, Task, Terminal, TreeView, Window,\nWorkspace — ~40 submodule files) and the remaining RPC services (Commands,\nConfiguration, Debug, EchoAction, Processes, SCM, Telemetry, Terminals, Types,\nVine, Windows, Workspace).\n\nAdd doc comments to Environment submodule declarations (DebugProvider, Feature-\nMethods, Utility, WebviewProvider), the ConfigurationProvider::Loading public\nre-export, and complete the TestProvider documentation pass with field-level\ndocs on TestRun, TestRunStatus, and TestResult structs plus blank-line\nseparators between enum variant docs across all TestProvider types.\n\nReplace `// TODO:` stubs in SecretProvider with structured docs noting the\nplanned Air integration and current NotImplemented return. Add section docs to\nSearchProvider::de_glob_list and UserInterfaceProvider::SendUserInterfaceRequest.\nTighten Vine module docs: replace \"Manages\"/\"Handles\" with \"Forwards\"/\n\"Dispatches\" on notification dispatchers, fix grammar in Client module docs.\n\nNon-docs: disable DevTools web inspector and clear trace logging in Info.plist;\nstrip lint blank lines from bootstrap-fork.js; fix shell-integration redirect\nsyntax; wrap README.md and Architecture.md to consistent 80-column prose.",
			"SHA": "f0cb6d150f0b7848962fd194f992e0d48e326e8b"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-12T19:14:15Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1861,
				14
			],
			"Message": "docs(Mountain): Add rustdoc comments to TerminalEnvCollection and TestProvider types, polish Vine module docs\n\nAdd field-level doc comments to `TestControllerState`, `TestProviderState`, and `TestResult` structs in the TestProvider module, and function-level doc comments to `Append`, `Prepend`, `Delete`, `Clear`, `SetPersistent`, and `SetDescription` in `TerminalEnvCollection`. Also add a short doc to the `ShellIntegration` submodule header in `Terminal/mod.rs`.\n\nRewrite Vine module documentation (`Vine/mod.rs`, `Vine/Server/mod.rs`, `Notification/mod.rs`, `Notification/Support/mod.rs`) to describe sidecar processes generically instead of singling out Cocoon, bringing the top-level module docs in line with the architecture's multi-sidecar design (`Air`, `Cocoon`). Tighten the `MountainVinegRPCService` module and struct doc comments to remove meta-instructional phrasing, and replace placeholder doc stubs (`\"Relays to sky.\"`, `\"Unregisters by handle.\"`) on `RelayToSky` and `UnregisterByHandle` with accurate descriptions.\n\nAdd meaningful doc to `TauriRendererEmitter::Emit` and improve `TauriRendererEmitter` struct doc to state its contract role as the `RendererEmitter` trait implementation for Tauri.",
			"SHA": "799f5fcdd015b0a9b097b57aae83f14b73738cc7"
		},
