				2
			],
			"Message": "docs(Mountain): Add rustdoc comments to TerminalEnvCollection and polish Initialize docs\n\nAdd doc comments with variant/field descriptions to `MutatorType`, `Mutator`, and `ExtensionCollection` types in `TerminalEnvCollection`, and to the `Replace` free function. These types manage environment variable mutations registered by extensions, mirroring VS Code's `EnvironmentVariableMutatorType`.\n\nRewrite the `Initialize` module doc to be more concise: replace the section-title header with a direct `//!` summary, tighten the lifecycle section, and fix several half-edited doc phrases that were left in a transitional state from an earlier rewrite pass.",
